# Animations

## Library
Framer Motion for UI; CSS transforms for micro-interactions; R3F for 3D.

## Defaults
- Duration: `0.4s`–`0.6s`
- Easing: `easeOut` or `[0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1]`
- GPU-friendly: `transform`, `opacity` only

## Patterns
- Scroll reveal: `FadeInView` wrapper with `whileInView`
- Stagger lists: `staggerChildren: 0.1`
- Hover: `scale: 1.03`, subtle shadow increase
- Hero: animated gradient backgrounds (CSS), not JS loops

## Performance
- `lazy()` + `dynamic()` for heavy animation/3D bundles
- `useReducedMotion()` hook — skip animations when preferred
- No layout-thrashing properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`)

## Limits
- Animate key elements only; avoid animating every child
- Max 2 concurrent hero animations
